합 FK 입니다 (uk_chapter_id_book 참조). 링크 3종(book_author·book_genre·book_category)만 book 삭제 시 CASCADE, 나머지는 모두 RESTRICT 입니다." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="1210" width="560" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sep" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2140" y="20" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="2140" y="1380" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="q_grp" value="" style="group;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2200" y="0" width="2150" height="1400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_title" value="Mobtwig 물리 ERD — 2차 (V4~V6, 15개 테이블)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#172b4d;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1500" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_sub" value="기준: server/src/main/resources/db/migration/V4~V6 SQL. 굵은 글씨=PK, 파랑=FK, UK=유니크, GEN=생성 컬럼, ?=NULL 허용. 선 끝의 갈래=N쪽, 막대=1쪽, 동그라미=NULL 허용 FK. 실선=ON DELETE RESTRICT, 점선=CASCADE. 가운데 회색 상자(참조)는 왼쪽 1차 영역의 member·book·chapter와 같은 테이블입니다. 선이 엉키지 않도록 다시 그렸습니다." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="2000" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_p_review" value="review" style="shape=swimlane;fontStyle=1;horizontal=1;startSize=28;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=14;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="40" y="724" width="300" height="208" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_p_review_c0" value='id  &lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="