yle="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1730" y="126" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_lg2" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="156" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_lt2" value="V6 미디어·커뮤니티" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1730" y="154" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_n_cas" value="CASCADE는 4곳뿐입니다: chapter_media(회차 삭제), post_image·post_sticker(글 삭제), post_comment_sticker(댓글 삭제). 나머지 FK는 모두 RESTRICT입니다." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="200" width="420" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_n_cmp" value="복합 FK (chapter(id, book_id) 참조, 다른 작품의 회차를 가리키지 못하게 막음): wiki_entry.reveal_chapter_id, member_wiki_range.limit_chapter_id, chapter_media.chapter_id(CASCADE), post.spoiler_chapter_id, post_comment.spoiler_chapter_id. post·post_comment의 book_id가 NULL이면 스포일러 회차도 NULL이어야 합니다(CHECK)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="270" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="q_n_ch" value="신고 처리 상태·위키 별칭(wiki_alias)·게시판 즐겨찾기는 V7 이후 후보입니다(정의서 '추가 기능 후보')." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="q_grp"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="390" width="420" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="1차 V1~V3 (19개)" id="erd-v1v3"><mxGraphModel 